    "STANDING collection 2026-09-29 by circulate; not read by R1 or R2. Raw pages (with SHA-256 above) are kept in the CI artifact / retained/, not committed.",
    "months returning 404 (the site lists no notices for them): 2026-06, 2026-07, 2026-08. A 404 is weaker evidence than an explicit \"no incidents\" page.",
    "SorryApp platform; parsed /history/<year>/<month> notice cards. The card shows only the \"Ended\" time, so started_utc == resolved_utc == Ended. SorryApp exposes no severity: impact_label is the card state (Resolved / Complete ...), severity is none. Cards in the Complete state are treated as maintenance; a Resolved card is an incident."
